Package: tarshare
Title: Share Computation Results Across 'targets' Pipelines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sounkou Mahamane", "Toure", email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("RGenomicsETL", role = "cph"))
Description: Reuse computations across independent 'targets' stores through an
    opt-in target factory and a shared filesystem cache. Computation keys include
    code, referenced values and helper functions, package identities, execution
    context, and a reproducible random seed. Supports ordinary R values and
    complete file bundles, immutable input identities, coordinated writers, and
    atomic publication. Uses public 'targets' interfaces without editing pipeline
    metadata.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://rgenomicsetl.github.io/tarshare/, https://github.com/RGenomicsETL/tarshare
